WEBVTT - Automated code migration: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:08.636
Forty extensions, one deprecated API, and nobody
wants to fix it by hand.

2
00:00:09.736 --> 00:00:15.914
Automated code migration: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:17.214 --> 00:00:27.023
Makes one extension work with a newer TYPO3 LTS,
with Extension Scanner, Rector, Fractor and
PHPStan.

4
00:00:28.373 --> 00:00:33.767
It treats a failing commit hook as a check to
fix, not an obstacle to skip.

5
00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:43.852
Fixes deprecated PHP calls with Rector: dry run,
review the diff, apply, dry run again.

6
00:00:45.202 --> 00:00:52.451
Apply, dry-run again: one generated file left.
Once more: Rector is done.

7
00:00:53.551 --> 00:01:02.053
Rewrites TypoScript, FlexForms, Fluid, YAML and
XLIFF towards v14 with Fractor.

8
00:01:03.403 --> 00:01:08.745
FlexForm, TypoScript and Fluid patterns are easy
to miss in a review.

9
00:01:10.145 --> 00:01:15.826
Applies one repeated change to many extensions
at once, in reviewable batches.

10
00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:20.846
A 500-file commit cannot be reviewed.

11
00:01:22.446 --> 00:01:26.769
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
